                        "datasheetId": "000002202",
                        "line": 1,
                        "button": "•",
                        "description": "Up to 4 Devastator Marines can each have their boltgun replaced with one of the following:<br><ul><li>1 grav-cannon</li><li>1 heavy bolter</li><li>1 lascannon</li><li>1 missile launcher</li><li>1 multi-melta</li><li>1 plasma cannon</li></ul>"
                    },
                    {
                        "datasheetId": "000002202",
                        "line": 2,
                        "button": "•",
                        "description": "The Devastator Sergeant’s bolt pistol and boltgun can be replaced with two different weapons from the following list:*<br><ul><li>1 Astartes chain sword</li><li>1 bolt pistol</li><li>1 boltgun</li><li>1 combi-weapon</li><li>1 grav-pistol</li><li>1 plasma pistol</li><li>1 power fist</li><li>1 power weapon</li><li>1 thunder hammer</li></ul>"
                    },
                    {
                        "datasheetId": "000002202",
                        "line": 3,
